A BARE VALUE BINDS A PHANTOM PARAMETER, and this line stands to show it. TiddlyWiki reads
`https` as a parameter name and the positional slot receives nothing — the reason every sigil
value in this house takes quotes. The form below carries the hazard on purpose.

<<~ kanawai https://example.com/reference>>

<<~ kanawai "https://example.com/reference">>

<<~ ahu #a-section>>

A body inside the section.

<<~ /ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>


<<~ set lares=`aim` from=`lar://alias:grant@host/a.b.c` to=`lar://alias:grant@host/d.e.f`>>

<<~! a pragma sigil>>

<<~?>>

<<~ hoike lar:///a.b.c -> ?>>

!! The turn frame, in the form the boot seed writes it

<<~ set lares=`aim` from=`lar://mara:operator@crossroads/operator.weighs.deps` to=`lar://compita:agent@crossroads/council.options.cuts` mode=`draft` mu=`_!` stance=`🏛️ 🗡️` aperture=`16/arc` ooda-ha=`7/declare-glyphs` drift-ward=`a preferred answer already stands and the comparison bends toward it`>>
<<~ oracle throw=`↯11 ✲ ⚃(4) ⁂:⬡🌖◈⟁`>>
<<~ set lares=`yield` drift-ward=`the read rides on a README and no changelog · ↻ L-Prime` aperture=`16/arc -> 12/measure` ooda-ha=`closed 0↺ -> open 1φ◇:fork.depends-on.maintenance-weight` from=`lar://compita:agent@crossroads/council.fork.named/awaiting-weight` to=`?`>>

!! The lens sigils, standing alone mid-stream

<<~ stance named=`poet humorist`>>
<<~ mu name=`Cup`>>

!! The rows, each a name and its parameters

<<~ mu name=`Wand` params=`ascii/* glyph/🜂 element/Fire feed/Visual pull/ignition`>>
<<~ carry name=`Detail` params=`ascii/* ascii/!`>>
<<~ season name=`Chaos` params=`glyph/✶ patron/Hung-Mung`>>
<<~ persona name=`Map-Wisp` params=`role/Scryer trigger/pattern-or-risk moves/map-structure-project-implication ~ diagrams the consequence path`>>
<<~ integrity name=`LitWard` params=`tell/Mana-Drift recover/re-light-L-Prime ~ map never fuses to territory`>>
<<~ shrine name=`Household` params=`gaia/home-niches-family-tended elyncia/single-orichalcum-figure ~ fed by one family or crew`>>
<<~ has entity=`frame` name=`set` params=`move/reality-tunnel fires/aim fires/steer fires/yield ~ one sigil, three firings`>>
<<~ loops phases=`✶ observe -> ⏿ orient -> ◇ decide -> ▶ act -> ↺ hoʻoko/aftermath`>>
<<~ config name=`Defaults`>>
<<~ node action=`refreshes the libation dish, the shrine incense burns`>>
